1. Proprietary Execution Engine (Closed Source)
The bare-metal substrate, Linux kernel modules (including `nava_brain` and
`nava_zzram`), and all executable C/Rust/Assembly implementations are strictly
proprietary industrial intellectual property of Eduardo Nava Hernandez / BACQM
Systems. No source code, binary module, or redistribution right is granted.
Hardware evaluation and benchmarks require a prior written NDA.

2. Open Formal Specifications & Benchmark Series
The mathematical specifications, documentation (`docs/`), and dimensionless
benchmark CSV datasets (`data/`, `campaign/`) published in this repository may
be inspected and cited for noncommercial academic research with attribution.

3. Upstream Lean 4 / Physlib Foundations
The referenced formal theorems in `leanprover-community/physlib` remain under
the Apache License 2.0 of Physlib.
